# "entered the battlefield under your control": Bot2's Ornithopter entering under Bot2's control leaves Bot1's Outrider at 3 power.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Bristlebane Outrider
Island x4
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Bristlebane Outrider.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield.Count = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Bristlebane Outrider.Power = 3
